SUMMARY:Tampa Bay Veg Fest
LOCATION:Perry Harvey\, Sr. Park 1000 E. Harrison St. Tampa \, FL 33602 Un
 ited States
DESCRIPTION:Florida Voices for Animals (http:www.floridavoicesforanimals.o
 rg) hosts our annual Tampa Bay Veg Fest (http:www.tampabayvegfest.com) on 
 Saturday November 14\, 2026\, 11am-5pm\, at Perry Harvey Sr Park\, 1000 E 
 Harrison St\, Tampa FL 33602. This is a free\, family-friendly event with 
 live music\, wonderful speakers\, cooking demos\, free samples\, kids acti
 vities\, lots of food product vendors. Live music will be played from the 
 newly built band shell! There will also be animal rescuessanctuaries (no l
 ive animals\, though). Tampa Bay Veg Fest is entirely put on by volunteers
 \, so we need your help! If you are willing to donate a couple hours of yo
 ur time on the day of the event or the day prior in exchange for a free ev
 ent T-shirt and vegan snack\, please sign up here: VolunteerSignup - Onlin
 e volunteer signup sheets - 14th Annual Tampa Bay Veg Fest -Nov. 14\, 2026
  signup sheet (https:volunteersignup.orgM7WQE) Please mark your calendar t
 o attend this wonderful event. Hope to see you there. \n\nPermalink: https
 ://www.tampa.gov/node/197391
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/197391
END:VEVENT
