SUMMARY:Live-to-Headphones Silent Piano Concert Meditation
LOCATION:Water Works 1710 Highland Ave. Tampa \, FL 33602 United States
DESCRIPTION:Overview Experience a musical journey of music  mindfulness th
 is November as MindTravel brings its signature live-piano compositions to 
 Tampa! MindTravel Live-to-Headphones: Immersive Piano Concert A mindful mu
 sic experience by composer pianist Murray Hidary Slip on wireless headphon
 es and be transported by MindTravels signature live-to-headphones silent p
 iano journey. Composer and pianist Murray Hidary creates an unforgettable 
 evening of soothing\, improvisational music designed to quiet the mind\, o
 pen the heart\, and connect you more deeply to yourself and those around y
 ou. Event Details When: Thursday\, November 19\, 2026  6:00PM (arrive 2030
  minutes early for check-in) Where: Water Works Park\, Tampa\, FL (on the 
 grass) Tickets: Limited headphones available  reserve yours in advance Wha
 t Youll Experience A live\, one-of-a-kind piano performance delivered dire
 ctly through premium wireless headphones A mindfulness-infused concert tha
 t brings you into presence and clarity A shared\, screen-free gathering th
 at fosters expansion\, connection\, and healing Who Its For MindTravel is 
 perfect for: Music lovers and creatives seeking inspiration Wellness and m
 indfulness seekers looking to reset Meditators (new or seasoned) ready to 
 deepen their practice Couples\, friends\, or solo adventurers looking for 
 a unique and meaningful night out What to Bring Bring whatever will keep y
 ou comfortable throughout the evening: A blanket\, low chair\, or cushion 
 (seating is not provided) A light layer for cooler temperatures Water to s
 tay hydrated An open mind and heart Good to Know Rain or shine. For light 
 rain\, the event continues. In cases of severe weather\, well notify ticke
 t holders by email with updates. Check in early. Headphones are limited an
 d distributed upon arrival. Family-friendly. Guests should be comfortable 
 sitting quietly for the duration. \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/nod
 e/197181
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/197181
END:VEVENT
